{"id":"f84b744ac7e877e9","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections.md","title":"Theorem II.6 Germ Charts and Open Sections","display":"Theorem II.6 Germ Charts and Open Sections","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections","aliases":["14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections"],"display":"Theorem II.6 Germ Charts and Open Sections","depends_on":["[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]","[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]"],"source_location":"II.5 printed 85; II.6 Proposition 1 printed 88; DjVu 48,50","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.6 Germ Charts and Open Sections"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08a9469876bddf9f\" href=\"?note=08a9469876bddf9f\" title=\"14-df-etale-space-of-germs\">14-df-etale-space-of-germs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.5 printed 85; II.6 Proposition 1 printed 88; DjVu 48,50"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> 为拓扑空间，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 为预层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_XP=(E_P,\\sigma_P,p_P)\">\\(\\Lambda_XP=(E_P,\\sigma_P,p_P)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08a9469876bddf9f\" href=\"?note=08a9469876bddf9f\" title=\"14-df-etale-space-of-germs\">14-df-etale-space-of-germs</a>。另设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\tau\">\\(U,V\\in\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)\">\\(s\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,V)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,V)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Etale}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sec}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}(p_P;E_P,\\sigma_P;X,\\tau),\\qquad\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall a\\in P(U)\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}(\\widehat a;U,\\tau|_U;B_P(U,a),\\sigma_P|_{B_P(U,a)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Etale}(p_P;E_P,\\sigma_P;X,\\tau),\\qquad\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall a\\in P(U)\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}(\\widehat a;U,\\tau|_U;B_P(U,a),\\sigma_P|_{B_P(U,a)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall W\\in\\sigma\\;(p[W]\\in\\tau),\\qquad s[U]\\in\\sigma,\\qquad\\{x\\in U\\cap V:s(x)=t(x)\\}\\in\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall W\\in\\sigma\\;(p[W]\\in\\tau),\\qquad s[U]\\in\\sigma,\\qquad\\{x\\in U\\cap V:s(x)=t(x)\\}\\in\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall W\\in\\sigma\\;\\forall e\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)\\;(e\\in s[U]\\subseteq W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall W\\in\\sigma\\;\\forall e\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)\\;(e\\in s[U]\\subseteq W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：茎截面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat a\">\\(\\widehat a\\)</span> 单射且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_P\\widehat a=\\mathrm{id}_U\">\\(p_P\\widehat a=\\mathrm{id}_U\\)</span>；基本像的交由局部等茎见证控制，故它和逆投影都连续。一般 étale 映射的局部同胚图使投影开放。任一连续截面在每个点附近必须落入一个这样的图，且等于图逆映射，故截面像开放。两截面相等的点可缩入共同图，在该图内投影单射迫使它们在邻域上相等。最后按点缩小局部图即得截面像基。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs","status":"resolved","id":"08a9469876bddf9f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs","status":"resolved","id":"08a9469876bddf9f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为预层；$\\Lambda_XP=(E_P,\\sigma_P,p_P)$ 使用 [[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]。另设 $\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)$，$U,V\\in\\tau$、$s\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,V)$，见 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为预层；$\\Lambda_XP=(E_P,\\sigma_P,p_P)$ 使用 [[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]。另设 $\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)$，$U,V\\in\\tau$、$s\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,V)$，见 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Etale}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sec}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Etale}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sec}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Etale}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sec}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_XP=(E_P,\\sigma_P,p_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"U,V\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Etale}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Etale}(p_P;E_P,\\sigma_P;X,\\tau),\\qquad\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall a\\in P(U)\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}(\\widehat a;U,\\tau|_U;B_P(U,a),\\sigma_P|_{B_P(U,a)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall W\\in\\sigma\\;(p[W]\\in\\tau),\\qquad s[U]\\in\\sigma,\\qquad\\{x\\in U\\cap V:s(x)=t(x)\\}\\in\\tau.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall W\\in\\sigma\\;\\forall e\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)\\;(e\\in s[U]\\subseteq W).","disp